### Test Authentication Endpoints

### 1. Login with Email
POST https://localhost:7000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrStaffId": "hr@tetfund.gov.ng",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1b. Login with StaffId
POST https://localhost:7000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrStaffId": "TET001",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Get Profile (requires authentication)
GET https://localhost:7000/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Refresh Token
POST https://localhost:7000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 4. Logout
POST https://localhost:7000/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test with invalid credentials
POST https://localhost:7000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}